{
  "name": "ondra-dialogue-protocol",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的对话帧协议（手册 §9.5）：text-delta / text-replace / crisis / usage / done 五帧，结束原因四值闭集。帧的形状、跨帧纪律（终帧唯一、usage 与 crisis 各一次）与 NDJSON 编解码只在这里存在一份——旧项目这三个形状散落在会话循环、界面、通道三处，于是「text-replace 被当增量追加」让用户看到两遍开头，「crisis 被静默丢掉」让危机提示永远到不了用户。不做业务判断、不改写正文、不落盘、不建 Session。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
